{
    "title": "Digital Striker Watch Face",
    "description": "Digital Striker Watch Face for Wear OS is watch face with digital characteristics and interactive functions.\r\n\r\nWatch face contains a huge number of settings on the watch and the phone companion app.\r\n\r\n\u2605 <b>Digital Striker Watch Face is fully Wear OS  supported</b>\r\n\r\n\u2605  Compatible with all WearOS smartwatches\r\n\r\n\u2605 <b>Free version </b>\u2605 \r\n    Complications:\r\n      \u2022 Weather  \r\n\r\n  Options:\r\n     \u2022 Change color \r\n     \u2022 24 hour format\r\n     \u2022 Leading zero\r\n     \u2022 Screen time\r\n     \u2022 Date formats\r\n\r\n\u2605 NEW option for Premium version \u2605\r\n     \u2022  Vibrate on every hour\r\n\r\n\u2605 <b>Premium version </b>\u2605\r\n  Built-in complications:\r\n    \u2022 Steps\r\n    \u2022 Distance\r\n    \u2022 Walking\r\n    \u2022 Running\r\n    \u2022 Biking\r\n    \u2022 Calories\r\n    \u2022 Fit statistics\r\n    \u2022 Water counter\r\n    \u2022 Coffee counter\r\n    \u2022 Hear Rate \r\n    \u2022 Built-In Steps\r\n\r\n   Options:\r\n     \u2022 External complications\r\n     \u2022 Change color \r\n     \u2022 24 hour format\r\n     \u2022 Leading zero\r\n     \u2022 Screen time\r\n     \u2022 Forecast\r\n     \u2022 Full ambient mode option\r\n     \u2022 Change a color preset on tap\r\n     \u2022 Date formats\r\n     \u2022 Tap indicator\r\n     \u2022  Google FIT integration\r\n     \u2022  Weather settings (location, providers, frequency update, units)\r\n\r\n\u2605\u2003<b>FAQ</b> \u2605\r\n!! Please contact us if you have any trouble with the app !! \r\nrichface.watch@gmail.com\r\n\r\n<b>How do I install the watch face on Wear OS ?</b>\r\n1. Install it from Google Play Wear Store on your <b> smartwatch. </b>\r\n2. Install the companion app for fully customization (Android phone devices).\r\n\r\n\u2605 DISCLAIMER \u2605\r\nThe free version doesn't have a tap functionality. It just shows data and the user won't be able to change it until unlock PREMIUM version.\r\n\r\n<b>Watch face cannot be install on smartwatches with Tizen OS or any other OS</b>\r\n\r\n\u2605 PERMISSIONS Explained\r\nhttps://www.richface.watch/privacy",
    "descriptionHTML": "Digital Striker Watch Face for Wear OS is watch face with digital characteristics and interactive functions.<br><br>Watch face contains a huge number of settings on the watch and the phone companion app.<br><br>\u2605 <b>Digital Striker Watch Face is fully Wear OS  supported</b><br><br>\u2605  Compatible with all WearOS smartwatches<br><br>\u2605 <b>Free version </b>\u2605 <br>    Complications:<br>      \u2022 Weather  <br><br>  Options:<br>     \u2022 Change color <br>     \u2022 24 hour format<br>     \u2022 Leading zero<br>     \u2022 Screen time<br>     \u2022 Date formats<br><br>\u2605 NEW option for Premium version \u2605<br>     \u2022  Vibrate on every hour<br><br>\u2605 <b>Premium version </b>\u2605<br>  Built-in complications:<br>    \u2022 Steps<br>    \u2022 Distance<br>    \u2022 Walking<br>    \u2022 Running<br>    \u2022 Biking<br>    \u2022 Calories<br>    \u2022 Fit statistics<br>    \u2022 Water counter<br>    \u2022 Coffee counter<br>    \u2022 Hear Rate <br>    \u2022 Built-In Steps<br><br>   Options:<br>     \u2022 External complications<br>     \u2022 Change color <br>     \u2022 24 hour format<br>     \u2022 Leading zero<br>     \u2022 Screen time<br>     \u2022 Forecast<br>     \u2022 Full ambient mode option<br>     \u2022 Change a color preset on tap<br>     \u2022 Date formats<br>     \u2022 Tap indicator<br>     \u2022  Google FIT integration<br>     \u2022  Weather settings (location, providers, frequency update, units)<br><br>\u2605\u2003<b>FAQ</b> \u2605<br>!! Please contact us if you have any trouble with the app !! <br>richface.watch@gmail.com<br><br><b>How do I install the watch face on Wear OS ?</b><br>1. Install it from Google Play Wear Store on your <b> smartwatch. </b><br>2. Install the companion app for fully customization (Android phone devices).<br><br>\u2605 DISCLAIMER \u2605<br>The free version doesn&#39;t have a tap functionality. It just shows data and the user won&#39;t be able to change it until unlock PREMIUM version.<br><br><b>Watch face cannot be install on smartwatches with Tizen OS or any other OS</b><br><br>\u2605 PERMISSIONS Explained<br>https://www.richface.watch/privacy",
